   "i": 15358,
   "title": "Payment Gateway v2 overcharging and invoice errors in US-West",
   "description": "We have identified a bug in Payment Gateway v2 in the US-West production environment where customers are being overcharged. The amount deducted from their bank accounts does not match the invoice generated by the system. About 9 customers have reported this discrepancy. The invoices show the correct intended amount, but the payment capture is higher. We need to understand if this is a calculation error in the gateway or a synchronization issue between the payment capture and the invoicing module. Please review the transaction logs for these specific accounts to pinpoint where the amount is being altered."
  },
