   "i": 15359,
   "title": "Data Export Service intermittent failures and high latency in ME",
   "description": "The Data Export Service in our Middle East production environment is experiencing intermittent failures. Roughly 20% of export jobs are timing out or failing to complete. When they do succeed, the latency is very high, often taking significantly longer than usual to process the data. This is affecting about 23 users who rely on these exports for reporting. We need to investigate the root cause of these sporadic timeouts and determine if there are resource constraints or network issues impacting the service performance during peak hours."
